-  Exit 124 or 137 is classed TIMEOUT only when the runner never wrote `RUNNER_DONE` and the measured elapsed time is at least
-  59.9 s; otherwise it is FAILED (an out-of-memory kill or the program's own status is not a proven deadline). A TIMEOUT is an
